---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="Freedom On Own Terms brings everything happening in the world of AI into one place: news, tools, guides and free tools for everyone.">
  <section class="container page-head">
    <h1>About <span class="gradient-text">Freedom On Own Terms</span></h1>
  </section>

  <section class="container prose">
    <p>
      AI is changing how we work, create, and live, and it's moving fast. New models, tools, and headlines arrive every day,
      scattered across hundreds of websites.
    </p>
    <p>
      We started <strong>Freedom On Own Terms</strong> with one simple idea: to bring everything happening in the world of
      AI into one place.
    </p>
    <h2>Who it's for</h2>
    <p>
      Everyone. You don't need a technical background. Whether you're a student, a job seeker, a business owner, or just
      curious, you'll find something here you can use today.
    </p>
    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/news/"><strong>AI news</strong></a>: headlines from leading tech publications and AI labs, updated daily.</li>
      <li><a href="/tools/"><strong>Tools directory</strong></a>: useful AI tools organized by what you want to get done.</li>
      <li><a href="/guides/"><strong>Guides</strong></a>: step-by-step, jargon-free articles on using AI in real life.</li>
      <li><a href="/prompts/"><strong>AI Prompt Library</strong></a>: ready-to-use prompts you can fill in and copy into any AI assistant.</li>
      <li><a href="/weather/"><strong>AI Weather Planner</strong></a>: your forecast, plus AI prompts that plan your day around it.</li>
      <li><a href="/shop/ai-career-kit/"><strong>AI Career Kit</strong></a>: a free PDF of prompts for resumes, interviews, and exams.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Our belief</h2>
    <p>
      Technology should give you more freedom, not less. Learn AI at your own pace, choose the tools that fit your
      goals, and use them on your own terms.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/contact/" class="btn primary">Get in touch</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
